#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:69 cff9da35153d4764accf66b2f0c7ee85
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn. All UARTS "
"are DMA capable"
msgstr ""
"上述引脚定义中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。所有 UART 均支持 "
"DMA。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:72 441edb12955148f8bdc7a2e20aa7240f
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:73 f2af0c463182400987b253713e60d8da
msgid ""
"SERIAL1 -> (External pads, and RX1 on DJI connector SBUS pin; defaulted to "
"MAVLINK2)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> （外部焊盘，以及 DJI 连接器 SBUS 引脚上的 RX1；默认为 MAVLINK2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:74 0c29f0f0ed4b410fa4ba69d0e273c89c
msgid "SERIAL2 -> UART2 (DJI Connector telemetry; defaulted to DisplayPort)"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> UART2（DJI 连接器数传；默认为 DisplayPort）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:75 0edd9296be184db19d2eba353a5721f1
msgid ""
"SERIAL3 -> UART3 (ESC connector telemetry pin, or external pad; defaulted to"
" ESC telemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> UART3（ESC 连接器数传引脚或外部焊盘；默认为 ESC 数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:76 8bb7f0c09e2a40eeb55ae04f2e951227
msgid "SERIAL4 -> USART4 (External pads; GPS protocol by default)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> USART4（外部焊盘；默认 GPS 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:77 24ef07f33f074d31aa41612c86f5d214
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART7 (Onboard ELRS receiver only, RCIN protocol)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART7（仅板载 ELRS 接收机，RCIN 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:78 2b0a8478b98a4e78956ddb7bf9a31188
msgid "SERIAL6 -> UART8 (USER, External pads)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART8（用户自定义，外部焊盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:80 101c6a5aa2bc4aabacf2e33065200453
msgid "Any UART may be re-tasked by changing its protocol parameter."
msgstr "任何 UART 均可通过更改其协议参数重新分配用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:83 a6d5efa5f4ac4e62976668bb61c722b6
msgid "Can FD port"
msgstr "CAN FD 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:85 59fc22457a634b3da895f3cec59aa4e4
msgid ""
"This flight controller includes a 4-pin DroneCAN standard CAN port. It's "
"capable of 64-byte frames, and up to 5Mbps data rates. It's useful for "
"connecting GPS devices, compasses, power monitoring, sensors, motors, "
"servos, and other CAN peripherals."
msgstr ""
"此飞控包含一个 4 针 DroneCAN 标准 CAN 端口。支持 64 字节帧，最高 5Mbps 数据速率。可用于连接 GPS "
"设备、罗盘、电源监测、传感器、电机、舵机及其他 CAN 外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:89 dc35d5a173514de28f43fd37a3910718
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:91 689667070eb0438db5f817813245624b
msgid ""
"This flight controller includes a 2.4Ghz ExpressLRS transceiver, capable of "
"receiving control input, and transmitting or receiving MavLink telemetry. To"
" enable all ELRS features, either RC5 channel should be setup as an ARM "
"switch (there are several RC5_OPTIONS that can do this) or by mapping the "
"transmitter's Channel 5 to reflect ARM status from telemetry. See: "
"https://youtu.be/YO2yA1fmZBs for an example."
msgstr ""
"此飞控包含一个 2.4GHz ExpressLRS 收发器，能够接收控制输入，并发送或接收 MAVLink 数传。要启用所有 ELRS 功能，应将 "
"RC5 通道设置为解锁开关（有几个 RC5_OPTIONS 可以实现），或将遥控器的第 5 "
"通道映射为从数传反映解锁状态。示例参见：https://youtu.be/YO2yA1fmZBs。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:93 aca1e85c4dbb47e1a3f66dbb7599fcf1
msgid ""
"SBUS on the DJI connector may be used if SERIAL5_PROTOCOL is changed to 0 "
"and SERIAL1_PROTOCOL is changed to 23 for RC input."
msgstr ""
"如果将 SERIAL5_PROTOCOL 改为 0 并将 SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 改为 23，可以使用 DJI 连接器上的 SBUS 作为 "
"RC 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:96 ce436e83e9ec45d39bf546a254136c8f
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:98 d095b6aa309f4faf986dc65013f4cc5c
msgid ""
"The Anyleafh7 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs 1-4 are available via an"
" JST-SH connectors. All 8 outputs support DShot and bi-directional DShot, as"
" well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"Anyleafh7 支持最多 8 路 PWM 输出。输出 1-4 通过 JST-SH 连接器引出。所有 8 路输出均支持 DShot 和双向 "
"DShot，以及所有 PWM 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:100 64640c553011447b9a0f133d476b718d
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:102 0989ad1aa1384f989740779a31fe7963
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:103 64e8f8e42d34414da465ecbf9341982b
msgid "PWM 5, 6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:104 a71ef1a322d54cbf98694374b422290d
msgid "PWM 7, 8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:106 34b0044194324073b6d4744062722a66
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需要使用相同的输出频率，无论是 PWM 还是 DShot。如果一组中任何通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:111 b592d5127110408ebf317fe7736cd6cb
msgid "Magnetometer"
msgstr "磁力计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:112 73db05c970c84e1bae83fa371950e405
msgid ""
"This flight controller does not have a built-in magnetometer, but you can "
"attach an external one using the CAN connector, or the I2C pads on the "
"bottom."
msgstr "此飞控没有内置磁力计，但可以使用 CAN 连接器或底部 I2C 焊盘连接外置磁力计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:116 1e4e915d1740482d8f287771456fb0d8
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:118 04e3b0f42fa8422fa35b6768761d43df
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the ESC connector, but no "
"internal current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the "
"CUR pin on the ESC connector. Default parameters for both internal voltage "
"and external current monitoring are set by default to the below and may need"
" to be changed depending on ESC used. The correct battery setting parameters"
" are:"
msgstr ""
"该板通过 ESC 连接器内置电压传感器，但没有内置电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接到 ESC 连接器上的 CUR "
"引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已预设如下，可能需要根据所用 ESC 进行调整。正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:121 610e435f52f048f98d71a1d9a2f863af
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:122 60dfa4e87d5843178b66042d1a7538be
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 18"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 18"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:123 1efad6a2eb9144fcbf9e20f711dd7b69
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 16"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 16"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:124 74bc27b909ed41e08e5e5ead4d88e61f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:125 67d394c5e377441f95592999a6da1b38
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 40, but "
"varies depending on external current sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"40，但因外部电流传感器不同而有所差异"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:128 66bb189339864d1b82368ff80c3c7d57
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:130 2adb934a177c4b0b909792797f64c485
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled “Anyleaf H7”."
msgstr "这些飞控的固件可在 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 的 「Anyleaf H7」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:132 c034a81e152d467a9e3d6f7004125103
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the boot "
"button pressed. Then you should load the \"AnyleafH7_with_bl.hex\" firmware,"
" using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初次固件烧录可通过按住 boot 按钮插入 USB 进行 DFU 烧录。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 烧录工具加载 "
"「AnyleafH7_with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:136 a804bb69fa584528b5f45e9f82e4d72c
msgid ""
"Subsequently, you can update firmware using Mission Planner or "
"QGroundControl."
msgstr "之后，可以使用 Mission Planner 或 QGroundControl 更新固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:138 a3791c35b38643df95de0a19e6642939
msgid "\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "\\*.apj 固件文件。"
